g [von nā́nā], nur im A. n. als Adverb.\n-ám {824,1} 〰 vaí u nas dhíyas.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["नानानं"], "synonyms_slp1": ["nAnAnaM"]}], "nanaraTam": [{"id": "nAnAraTam", "headword": "नानारथम्", "headword_slp1": "nAnAraTam", "fold": "nanaraTam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "grassman-sanskrit-german", "senses": [{"gloss": "nānā-rathám, A. als Adverb, auf verschiedenen Wagen (rátha), mit dem Gegensatze sarátham auf demselben Wagen {240,9} ā́‿ebhis (devébhis) agne sarátham yāhi arvā́ṅ, 〰 vā.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "nanasurya": [{"id": "nAnAsUrya", "headword": "नानासूर्य", "headword_slp1": "nAnAsUrya", "fold": "nanasurya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "grassman-sanskrit-german", "senses": [{"gloss": "nā́nā-sūrya, a., von verschiedenen Sonnen (sū́rya) beschienen.\n-ās [N. p. f.] saptá díśas 〰 {826,3}.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "nandana": [{"id": "nAndana", "headword": "नान्दन", "headword_slp1": "nAndana", "fold": "nandana", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "grassman-sanskrit-german", "senses": [{"gloss": "(nāndaná), n., Freudenort, Paradies [v. nand].\n-ám [A.] SV. 〔II,5,2,8,6〕.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "nandi": [{"id": "nAndI", "headword": "नान्दी", "headword_slp1": "nAndI", "fold": "nandi", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "grassman-sanskrit-german", "senses": [{"gloss": "nāndī́, f., Freude, Lust [von nand].\n-íam [A.] {34,4}.\n-íe [D.] {145,4} neben mudé.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["नांदी"], "synonyms_slp1": ["nAMdI"]}]}